id: hac-mw4f
title: Expose non-primary entities in typed target topology
description: Add an explicit typed CLI control for Core's primary_entities_only extraction schema and propagate it through related-registry discovery without changing safe defaults.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[7]: agents,api,home-assistant,live-e2e,target,typescript,websocket
