author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: ws target extract and related expose a clear flag for secondary entities; default and opt-in payloads match Core 2026.8.1; tests assert behavior; live 2026.7.4 accepts the option; docs/help/schema and six formats remain valid; exact coverage stays 100/100/100/100
definition_of_ready: "Core tagged schema and introduction commit, prior target lineage, current CLI behavior, and live version are known."
goal: best-agent-home-assistant-cli
objective: lossless-agent-target-topology
value: Let agents plan automations against complete entity topology when needed.
impact: Avoids silently omitting secondary entities such as configuration or diagnostic entities from explicit topology work.
outcome: Typed safe primary/secondary target discovery.
why_now: The Core control has existed since 2026.5 but is absent from the typed CLI surface.
