reviewer: unbraind
risk: medium
confidence: 99
sprint: 2026-08-target-topology
release: unreleased
resolution: Added explicit --include-secondary support to extract and related while preserving primary-only defaults.
expected_result: Opt-in requests send primary_entities_only=false and default requests omit it.
actual_result: "Focused tests, all 1,407 tests, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, built help, and live 2026.7.4 read-only execution passed."
