comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T21:30:10.685Z",codex-root,Official Core 2026.8.1 schema defines primary_entities_only with default true; the local CLI currently omits the payload field and cannot opt out.
  "2026-08-09T21:30:25.699Z",codex-root,"Implementation decision: use --include-secondary on extract and related; emit primary_entities_only:false only when set so the default wire payload remains backward-compatible."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T21:30:10.685Z",codex-root,Live assertions must use an ephemeral discovered entity selector and retain only structural pass/fail evidence.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T21:30:10.685Z",codex-root,Preserving the upstream primary-only default avoids surprising payload growth; complete topology should be explicit.
